body:
@Alamoz may you post `request.env` for your action. Because, I added simple test case for your issue, and all tests passed for **3-2-stable**, **v3.2.12**, **master**.

I think, your server have not set `ENV['CONTENT_LENGTH']` properly.

Also repeated your steps to reproduce issue for ruby 2.0.0-p247, rails 4.0.0 (gem):

``` bash
this is request.raw_post =
{"post":{"title":"my title"}}
this is request.params = {"post"=>{"title"=>"my title"}, "action"=>"create", "controller"=>"posts"}
```
